..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : LPROV.EV
.. Autor          : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : tiwe
.. Funktion       : Eingaben pruefen und Anfrage formulieren.
.. Ablauf         : Button-nach-EFOP
..
.. Functionality  : Validates input and builds query.
.. Program flow   : After button efop
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Validate input
.continue ERROR01 ? _F|empty(M|kbis) & (M|kbis < M|kvon)
..
.. Clear table
.input "is/TABLEEREN"
..
.. Build query
.formula M|select = "$,,@ordnung=artpg,vetpg,gltvon,gltbis;@ablageart=(Active);@gruppe=1"
.continue BOTHGRP ? _F|empty(M|kartpg) & _F|empty(M|kvertpg)
.continue PRODUCT ? _F|empty(M|kartpg) &  F|empty(M|kvertpg)
.continue REPRSNT ?  F|empty(M|kartpg) & _F|empty(M|kvertpg)
.continue END
..
!BOTHGRP: Representative and product
.formula M|select = M|select + ";artpg==" + M|kartpg + ";vetpg==" + M|kvertpg
.continue END
..
!REPRSNT: Only representative
.formula M|select = M|select + ";vetpg==" + M|kvertpg
.continue END
..
!PRODUCT: Only product
.formula M|select = M|select + ";artpg==" + M|kartpg
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
..*****************************************************************************
..
!ERROR01: Illegal date area!
.error -line 0 -field M|kvon -message Unzul„ssiger Zeitraum.
.end 1
